#11200
Credits for Valley of the Mad Mage~
The Valley of the Mad Mage is designed to be a small XP place for
levels 20+.  It also contains some specialized EQ and a receptionist
for the Ranger class.  The area allows room for future expansion.

Smythe
written for RavenMud, December 1995
~
112 d 0 0 0 0
S
#11201
Cave Entrance~
You are in a small, rough cave.  Its walls seem to have been naturally
formed by erosion, but to the west, there are signs that the wall has
been chisled.  There is an exit to the east that leads out between two
large boulders, and to the west the cave seems to expand.
~
